      "text": "# AGENTS.md instructions\n\n<INSTRUCTIONS>\n## 写作风格\n\n当任务涉及“去 AI 味”“说人话”“自然一点”“别像模板”这类改写时，使用本地 skill `shuorenhua`。\n对外文本优先按它处理；代码、日志、配置和命令输出不套这个 skill。\n</INSTRUCTIONS>\n<environment_context>\n  <cwd>~/Documents/personalcodexfile/第二次课/outputs/route_layer/r4_codex_task9_progress_feedback_v3_resume_from_7_20261026_v1/codex_empty_workspace</cwd>\n  <shell>bash</shell>\n  <current_date>2026-10-26</current_date>\n  <timezone>Asia/Shanghai</timezone>\n  <filesystem><workspace_roots><root>~/Documents/personalcodexfile/第二次课/outputs/route_layer/r4_codex_task9_progress_feedback_v3_resume_from_7_20261026_v1/codex_empty_workspace</root></workspace_roots><permission_profile type=\"managed\"><file_system type=\"restricted\"><entry access=\"read\"><special>:root</special></entry></file_system></permission_profile></filesystem>\n</environment_context>"
